Idol was developed by Sperid Labs (speridlabs/idol, Apache-2.0). This package runs the unmodified idol-sdk
(github.com/speridlabs/idol-sdk, commit 4702a7f, Apache-2.0) and replaces its denoiser sampler with a native
implementation that reads the unmodified Idol weights. Model weights are downloaded separately from their pinned
upstream repositories; none are redistributed here.

